message: If you use this software in your research, please cite it using the following
  metadata.
title: 'pmwMRMS: A Python Package for Spatiotemporal Collocation of Passive Microwave
  Observations and Multi-Radar Multi-Sensor Precipitation'
type: software
authors:
- given-names: Buddha
  family-names: Subedi
  affiliation: University of Minnesota
abstract: An open-source Python package for automated downloading, bidirectional spatiotemporal
  collocation, and visualization of satellite passive microwave brightness temperatures
  and ground-based Multi-Radar Multi-Sensor rainfall and snowfall observations.
url: https://pypi.org/project/pmwMRMS/
keywords:
- Passive microwave
- MRMS
- Rainfall
- Snowfall
- Satellite remote sensing
- Ground-based radar
- Spatiotemporal collocation
- Precipitation validation
- Machine learning
- Python
repository-code: https://github.com/Buddha-subedi/pmwMRMS_python_package
